    "title": "条 / 位: Use 条/位/间/名 and borrowed 包 with compatible nouns",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk2-quantities-p02-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "条 / 位: Use 条/位/间/名 and borrowed 包 with compatible nouns",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Match classifiers to nouns: 条 for compatible long items, 位 for respectful people, 间 for rooms, 名 for counted persons, and 包 for packaged quantities.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这条路很长。",
                "pinyin": "zhè tiáo lù hěn cháng 。",
                "meaning": "This road is long.",
                "audio": "9c0f5f380f14442fa3f56b074335013260b730027729ec189a1c6afc9583f1de"
              },
              {
                "text": "一位老师来了。",
                "pinyin": "yī wèi lǎoshī lái le 。",
                "meaning": "A teacher came.",
                "audio": "3632df3909a484aa3280e689d3e223d59e9e9cd50e84daefdc1c1e87758c980b"
              },
              {
                "text": "这里有两间房间。",
                "pinyin": "zhèlǐ yǒu liǎng jiān fángjiān 。",
                "meaning": "There are two rooms here.",
                "audio": "86e7edc02e4e96ce11e52e255fdb6c3270bb516cbaa036bbdd71ead4bfc76e3b"
              },
              {
                "text": "三名学生来了。",
                "pinyin": "sān míng xuéshēng lái le 。",
                "meaning": "Three students came.",
                "audio": "2925bf25879df6001f33fc45c5dceddf28d49727cce9adb6d01120760346346e"
              },
              {
                "text": "我买一包茶。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ mǎi yī bāo chá 。",
                "meaning": "I am buying a packet of tea.",
                "audio": "58272462fa23537af2104189e84387f1889be8c3b93ad1d29e8de99dee426854"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
